abstract: >-
  Research prototype implementing the Accountable Agentic Evidence (AAE) model:
  agent functions F1-F4 that work on metadata only, human gates G1-G3, an
  append-only hash-chained decision record, RACI role checks, graduated
  autonomy zones Z1-Z4 with escalation triggers, and interagency evidence bundles.
